  "summary": {
    "as": "Introduced in House",
    "asOf": "2026-07-09",
    "date": "2026-09-11T20:09:49Z",
    "text": "Battery Recycling for America\u2019s Competitive Economy Act or the BRACE Act\n\nThis bill modifies the regulation of lithium-ion batteries under the Resource Conservation and Recovery Act in order to facilitate the recycling of lithium-ion batteries and the recovery of critical minerals. Specifically, the bill directs certain facilities that store lithium-ion batteries prior to recycling them to follow regulations for large quantity handlers of universal waste instead of following the more stringent hazardous waste regulations that currently apply, thereby allowing these facilities to store lithium-ion batteries without needing a special permit."
  },
